To score from node (a whole number).
If node is less than 0, return.
The left is item node of lefts.
The right is item node of rights.
If left is at least 0, score from left.
If right is at least 0, score from right.
The total is item node of values.
If left is at least 0, set total to total plus item left of sums.
If right is at least 0, set total to total plus item right of sums.
Set item node of sums to total.
Place total into allsums.

To tally from spot (a whole number) with target (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of allsums, return.
If item spot of allsums is target, add 1 to occurrences.
Tally from spot plus 1 with target.

